  "sangamTamil": "ஆடுகோ டாகி அதரிடை நின்றதூஉம்\nகாழ்கொண்ட கண்ணே களிறணைக்கும் கந்தாகும்\nவாழ்தலும் அன்ன தகைத்தே ஒருவன்றான்\nதாழ்வின்றித் தன்னைச் செயின்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "By energy a man makes himself. What once stood by the wayside, a twig that bent to every touch, when its core is developed within, may become a stake to which they tie an elephant. Life too is thus, if man himself, unfailing make himself !",
